---

<section class="section refer" id="refer">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rv refer-in">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Refer a mate</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top: 12px">Know a driver who dreads tax time?<br />Send them our way, pocket <em>&pound;50</em>.</h2>
        <p class="lead2">Our best clients come from a word in the cab office. Refer any self-employed driver and you get &pound;50 cash when they join. They get a free first consultation.</p>
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="rstep"><div class="n">1</div><div><b>Give us a call</b><p>Tell us who you're referring, or pass them our number.</p></div></div>
          <div class="rstep"><div class="n">2</div><div><b>They sign up</b><p>They start on any monthly plan. No catch, cancel anytime.</p></div></div>
          <div class="rstep"><div class="n">3</div><div><b>You both win</b><p>You get &pound;50 cash once they complete their first payment. They get sorted with HMRC.</p></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="rcard">
        <span class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--yellow)">Your reward</span>
        <div class="fifty">&pound;50 <small>cash</small></div>
        <p class="fine">for every driver you refer who joins</p>
        <a class="btn btn-y" href="tel:07799414972">Ring to refer a mate</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="refnote rv">Referral reward paid once your referred driver completes their first monthly payment. Full terms provided on request.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .refer-in {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 26px;
    padding: 44px;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .refer-in::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    right: -80px;
    top: -80px;
    width: 260px;
    height: 260px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, var(--yellow-soft), transparent 70%);
  }

  .refer h2 {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
    position: relative;
  }

  .refer h2 em {
    font-style: normal;
    color: var(--yellow-deep);
  }

  .refer .lead2 {
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-top: 14px;
    max-width: 38ch;
    position: relative;
  }

  .steps {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
    margin-top: 26px;
    position: relative;
  }

  .rstep {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .rstep .n {
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    flex: none;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--yellow);
    font-weight: 800;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .rstep b {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 15px;
  }

  .rstep p {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--ink-2);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .rcard {
    background: var(--ink);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 34px 30px;
    color: #fff;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .rcard .fifty {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 64px;
    color: var(--yellow);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-top: 14px;
  }

  .rcard .fifty small {
    font-size: 20px;
    color: #fff;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .rcard .fine {
    color: #c3bdb1;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    margin: 6px 0 22px;
  }

  .rcard .btn {
    justify-content: center;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .refnote {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--ink-3);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    margin-top: 18px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 960px) {
    .refer-in {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: 32px;
    }
  }
</style>
